  question: 'Find the wrong word in this sentence: The cat no longer <color=yellow>has</color>
    the scholar hat on its head, it looks at me <color=yellow>ambiguous</color> and
    <color=yellow>speaks</color> to me with the meow sound, <color=yellow>instead</color>
